2. $f(x, y) = 6x^{2/3}y^{1/2}$  at  $x = 998$  and  $y = 101.5$ ;
3. $f(x, y, z) = \sqrt{x^{1/2} + y^{1/3} - 5z^2}$  at  $x = 4.2$ ,  $y = 7.95$ , and  $z = 1.02$ .

