$$c) y = ce^t + t^2 + 2t + 2, \quad \dot{y} = y - t^2;$$

$$d) y = \frac{1}{4}(2t^2 + 6t + 7) + c_1 e^t + c_2 e^{2t}, \quad \ddot{y} = 3\ddot{y} - 2y + t^2.$$

