**25.6** Use the techniques of this section to find the general solution of the following systems of differential equations. In addition, find the particular solution which satisfies  $y_1(0) = 1, y_2(0) = 0$ .

| a) $\dot{y}_1 = y_1 + y_2$   | b) $\dot{y}_1 = y_1 - 5y_2$  | c) $\dot{y}_1 = -3y_1 + 5y_2$ |
|------------------------------|------------------------------|-------------------------------|
| $\ddot{y}_2 = 4y_1 - 2y_2$ ; | $\ddot{y}_2 = 2y_1 - 5y_2$ ; | $\ddot{y}_2 = -y_1 + y_2$ .   |

