**26.3** Show that if  $a_{11}a_{22} - a_{21}a_{12} = 0$ , then the expression for  $\det A$  in (5) equals  $-(a_{23}a_{11} - a_{21}a_{13})(a_{11}a_{32} - a_{31}a_{12})/a_{11}$ .

**26.4** a) Check that (10) yields the same formula as (5).  
b) Use another row and another column of the  $3 \times 3$  matrix  $A$  to calculate  $\det A$  and check that you obtain the same expression as (5).

**26.5** Write out a careful proof of Theorem 26.2.

**26.6** Use the method of Figure 26.1 to compute the two  $3 \times 3$  determinants in Exercise 26.1.

