**26.35** a) Calculate the parity of each of the two permutations of  $(1, 2)$  and each of the six permutations of  $(1, 2, 3)$ .  
 b) Show that (36) is the same as (1) for  $2 \times 2$  matrices and the same as (5) for  $3 \times 3$  matrices.

